ですが目は開けた状態で描いて頂きたいです。 また、デジカメの位置は少し下げて顔全体が見えるようにしていただきたいです。背景は写真と似たような雰囲気でお願いします。 \n引き受けて頂けたら嬉しいです。\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/exdjtjv1x5ytdj92takf0/ADMWmgpTjb4E2_UagfS7mGo?rlkey=coar7wwm09jo6vhl1idu6rqvs&st=fmgjws0b&dl=0\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/exdjtjv1x5ytdj92takf0/ADMWmgpTjb4E2_UagfS7mGo?rlkey=coar7wwm09jo6vhl1idu6rqvs&st=fmgjws0b&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@chako_101/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c985a67/uploads/origins/0d4275dd-ded2-4b91-8318-50f85d14c076?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=850cf0a46d1ed23bca2391b7c6d54fac", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6c985a67/uploads/origins/0d4275dd-ded2-4b91-8318-50f85d14c076?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=850cf0a46d1ed23bca2391b7c6d54fac, https://si.imgix.net/6c985a67/uploads/origins/0d4275dd-ded2-4b91-8318-50f85d14c076?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa4da4d0c19dbba2247d83a17d319db6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6c985a67/uploads/origins/0d4275dd-ded2-4b91-8318-50f85d14c076?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f7263e177d3dd3a74e7766dbafc1e68 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "您好 我想要一張hsk姐貴的畫像(cookie) 請您自由發揮❤️ 我想用作頭像", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@chako_101/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3b2c3c3e/uploads/origins/4d593bb5-ecfc-4208-a3dd-96cfa0a78eff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a40ec4b0a6284c8c11a04c5dbe039175", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3b2c3c3e/uploads/origins/4d593bb5-ecfc-4208-a3dd-96cfa0a78eff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a40ec4b0a6284c8c11a04c5dbe039175, https://si.imgix.net/3b2c3c3e/uploads/origins/4d593bb5-ecfc-4208-a3dd-96cfa0a78eff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b066eafc7dabcfaf